__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
wordmark-*.svg

# Source photos are deliberately NOT published.
#
# A profile README repo has to be public, so anything committed here is a
# permanent, publicly downloadable file, and git history keeps it even if it is
# deleted later. The full-resolution original is not needed for the profile to
# render: portrait-ascii.svg is committed and is the only thing the README
# loads. Keep the originals locally so you can re-run prep_photo.py.
#
# Delete these two lines if you would rather publish them.
source-photo.*
source-prepped.png
